# Optional WebDAV mounts: HTTP(S)-URL absolute_mountpoint
# Blank lines and comments (including indented comments) are ignored.
# Exactly two whitespace-separated fields; no whitespace within either field.
# Store credentials in /etc/davfs2/secrets, never in the URL.
# Configure trust_ca_cert or trust_server_cert in davfs2.conf as needed.
# The former ignore_cert option is rejected; it never accepts a certificate.
# https://cloud.example.com/remote.php/dav/files/username /mnt/dav/cloud
